Nix 2.36 compatibility for nix-eval-jobs 2.35.4/main.

Based on John Ericson's nix-next port ef72a54725509bc59b177d815ca544d979f3c270:
https://github.com/NixOS/nix-eval-jobs/commit/ef72a54725509bc59b177d815ca544d979f3c270
Retains current main's store, scheduling, and logging fixes; additionally
adapts const Bindings and the current Logger noexcept/span API.
Remove when upstream main supports the selected Nix master API.

